{
  "info": {
    "name": "AI Roadmap API — Phase 3 Verification",
    "_postman_id": "ai-roadmap-phase3-verify",
    "description": "Verifies the multi-profile backend (Phases 2 + 3). Run in order — later requests depend on state set by earlier ones.\n\nWhat this does:\n1. Confirms the API is healthy.\n2. Reads the current profile list as a baseline.\n3. Creates a throwaway `postman-test-*` profile with the `ai_fullstack` roadmap variant.\n4. Activates it, confirms it starts empty (isolation on reads).\n5. Writes checklist, leetcode, note, milestone, and per-profile settings on it.\n6. Reads them back to confirm the writes landed.\n7. Switches back to profile 1 and asserts NONE of those writes bled over.\n8. Confirms you cannot delete the active profile.\n9. Deletes the throwaway profile and confirms count is restored.\n\nYour existing profile-1 data is only read, never written.\n\nHow to run:\n- Postman: Import → Runner → pick collection → Run.\n- Newman:  `npx newman run \"postman/AI_Roadmap_Phase3_Verification.postman_collection.json\"`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "A. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"status = 'ok'\", () => pm.expect(data.status).to.eql('ok'));",
                  "pm.test(\"database = 'connected'\", () => pm.expect(data.database).to.eql('connected'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
